OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry start with bright spells
OL,6,Ffor Shetland, then a few showers in
OL,7,Fthe afternoon. Mostly cloudy for
OL,8,FOrkney with scattered showers and
OL,9,Ffreshening easterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will stay mostly cloudy
OL,12,Fthrough the evening with further
OL,13,Fshowers. A few more clear spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping overnight for Shetland, but
OL,15,Fstill mostly cloudy with showers.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FVariable cloud and bright
OL,18,Fspells through the day with a
OL,19,Fscattering of showers, these blustery
OL,20,Fat times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
